OL,3,GNEWSAIrish reality star dances her way 
OL,4,Ato final of Dancing with the Stars     
OL,6,FThe Irish reality TV star cha cha cha'd
OL,7,Fher way to the final of Dancing With   
OL,8,Fthe Stars on US television, where she  
OL,9,Fcompeted with her professional dance   
OL,10,Fpartner Mark Ballas, son of Strictly   
OL,11,Fhead judge Shirley Ballas.             
